<h1>MISSION</h1>
<h7>At Hoerskool Die Adelaar, we are dedicated to building adaptable, learner-centered school communities that actively support each learner's leadership and academic progress. 
    Our mission is to cultivate the abilities and mindsets essential for success in an ever-changing world. We encourage innovation, critical thinking, and collaboration, 
    empowering our students to become lifelong learners and leaders in their communities.</h7>

<br/>
<br/>

<h1>VISION</h1>
<h7>Our Vision is to create well-rounded, self-assured, and responsible individuals who aspire to reach their greatest potential. We strive for excellence by fostering a culture of respect, inclusivity, and empathy, where every learner feels valued and inspired to contribute to the world around them..</h7>
<h7>o achieve this vision, we will provide a warm, joyful, secure, and encouraging learning environment that celebrates diversity and recognizes the unique accomplishments of each individual. Our commitment is to engage families, educators, and community members in the educational journey, ensuring that our students are supported holistically as they develop the skills necessary for success in the future. Together, we are shaping a brighter tomorrow, one learner at a time..</h7>


